  "title": "Brigitte Possible NDE 7988",
  "date": "25/02/2011",
  "content": "I was working at night, was not used to have dinner. As it was the anniversary of my brother I went for dinner to my mother's place, was eating well and had fun. An evening not as usual, special, as viewed later on. After this, after dinner I went to pick up a workmate, there was a bit snow falling, that was beautiful and magic. At work as usual, while working, I'm joking with the employees; I'm working at a hospital and clean the house, but I love my job and have fun with everybody. But we are very busy, it's 5:00 in the morning, exhausted of the night, as we had been reduced, not enough people, and a colleague has to leave. I have still two rooms to clean, one far away, even isolated and the other one is the room where patients are waiting to see the doctor. I'm starting with this one, I'm entering it and it is as if the light went off. This was told me afterwards, as I don't remember; they found me on the floor spread out in the form of a star, and I had emptied myself. A nurse touched me and it was there that I had my last breath. They massaged me, shocked me, and I got a slight pulse, I was intubated, was in catheterization laboratory, they wanted to unblock me, but I had another attack. They stopped, I had 4 blocked arteries, got unblocked two of them. They didn't think that I would be coming back, on the paper the diagnose was sudden death and the main diagnose sudden death, I went to intensive care, was in a coma for 9 days and I came back and show nothing on my heart, nothing shows of that night. I saw myself in an igloo, in a pyramid and saw deceased people, and today I'm here and am writing to you; after this I went to intensive care services to ask them why this igloo and pyramid. They told me that maybe when they put a cover on me to preserve my organs and / or when they started to warm up my body again.",
